      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Reference Image Resolution\n\nSenseNova-U1 image editing works best when reference images are resized before they are passed to **HiDream-O1 Reference Images**.\n\nConnect each reference image as follows:\n\n`Load Image → Scale Image to Total Pixels → HiDream-O1 Reference Images`\n\nRecommended resize settings:\n\n- **Upscale method:** `lanczos`\n- **Resolution steps:** `32`\n- **1–2 reference images:** `4.0 MP` per image\n- **More than 2 reference images:** share an `8.0 MP` total budget across all reference images\n\nFor `N > 2`, set each image to approximately:\n\n`8.0 / N MP`\n\nExamples:\n\n- 1 image: `4.0 MP`\n- 2 images: `4.0 MP` each\n- 3 images: `2.67 MP` each\n- 4 images: `2.0 MP` each\n\nThis resizing applies only to reference images. The generated image resolution is controlled separately by the latent width and height.\n\nThe shared budget limits the number of visual-prefix tokens and helps avoid excessive VRAM usage and slower inference."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Reference Image Resolution\n\nSenseNova-U1 image editing works best when reference images are resized before they are passed to **HiDream-O1 Reference Images**.\n\nConnect each reference image as follows:\n\n`Load Image → Scale Image to Total Pixels → HiDream-O1 Reference Images`\n\nRecommended resize settings:\n\n- **Upscale method:** `lanczos`\n- **Resolution steps:** `32`\n- **1–2 reference images:** `4.0 MP` per image\n- **More than 2 reference images:** share an `8.0 MP` total budget across all reference images\n\nFor `N > 2`, set each image to approximately:\n\n`8.0 / N MP`\n\nExamples:\n\n- 1 image: `4.0 MP`\n- 2 images: `4.0 MP` each\n- 3 images: `2.67 MP` each\n- 4 images: `2.0 MP` each\n\nThis resizing applies only to reference images. The generated image resolution is controlled separately by the latent width and height.\n\nThe shared budget limits the number of visual-prefix tokens and helps avoid excessive VRAM usage and slower inference."
      },
